  shared components -> @/components/data-display (AnimatedNumber) -> TSAnimatedNumber;
    @/components/motion (motion) -> TSFadeIn + a reduce-motion hero scale entrance. Both
    compiled against the REAL Components in the typechecks below. Recharts -> none /
    Leaflet -> none (no chart/map on this surface).
  states (all render) -> loading (redacted hero skeleton) · empty (ContentUnavailableView,
    never a blank box) · error (QueryError-equivalent with retry; native chrome since the
    web relies on the story shell's react-query handling) · stale (freshness chip + banner +
    one guarded auto-refresh) · offline (cached value + chip + banner) · content. Cached
    data stays visible behind refresh/transient failure, matching the web shell.
  i18n -> the source key `t('yearReview.title','Year in Review')` resolves through the
    P1/S10 facade (table "TitleSlide", key "yearReview.title" = "Year in Review" — the
